  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCB support to statistic in Albania 2024 - 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SCB-st&#xf6;d till statistik i Albanien 2024 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att utv&#xe4;rdera resultaten fr&#xe5;n samarbetet 2001 &#xad; 2021 och att designa ett
potentiellt l&#xe5;ngsiktigt samarbete med INSTAT. Samt att bidra med st&#xf6;d i form av
kortsiktig expertis till INSTAT g&#xe4;llande utl&#xe4;mnande av data fr&#xe5;n folk&#xad; och
bostadsr&#xe4;kningen 2023, och situationen f&#xf6;r cybers&#xe4;kehet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To evaluate the results of the collaboration 2001 2021 and to design a
potential long-term collaboration with INSTAT. As well as contributing with support in the form of
short-term expertise to INSTAT regarding the release of data from people and
the 2023 housing bill, and the state of cyber security.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assess the results of the cooperation 2001-2021 and design a potential longer term cooperation with INSTAT as well as support with short term expertise to INSTAT regarding data disclosure of 2023 Population and Housing Census and cybersecurity situation.</narrative>
  </description>
